GAMING CAFE NETWORK - ROUTER AND SWITCH
==========================================


STEP 1 - CONNECT THE ISP LINE
-----------------------------
Connect the ISP (Internet Service Provider) line to the ROUTER.

Reason:
The router connects the cafe local network to the Internet.
It can also provide IP addresses and manage network traffic.

