STEP 2 - CONNECT ROUTER TO SWITCH
---------------------------------
Connect one LAN/Ethernet port of the router to a port on the
network switch using an Ethernet cable.

Reason:
The switch provides multiple ports so that many devices can
connect to the same local network.

ISP -> ROUTER -> SWITCH


